    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned those areas have \"unpredictable populations\" and \"diverse crowds\" which makes them rougher. Can you be a bit more specific about why the diversity or the immigrant background in places like Brixton or Peckham makes them specifically less safe or more \"unpredictable\" for a tourist compared to, say, a high-crime area in a more homogenous suburb?",
